{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-design-patterns","title":"指标设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/metrics-design-patterns","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"指标设计模式\">指标设计模式</h1><p>指标（Metrics）是可观测性三支柱中<strong>成本最低、保留最久</strong>的信号——一个 counter 每秒只产生几字节，却能保留数年的趋势。但指标的价值完全取决于设计质量：选错了 SLI、用错了类型、标签基数爆炸，轻则 Dashboard 无法回答问题，重则 TSDB 存储成本失控。本文覆盖三套经典指标框架（USE/RED/四大黄金信号）的选择逻辑，以及从零设计一个服务指标体系的工程方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>指标设计的基本术语决定了“用什么类型、怎么切分、何时告警”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在设计中的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>累计计数，只增不减</td>\n<td>请求数、错误数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>瞬时值，可增可减</td>\n<td>队列深度、goroutine 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>值分布（桶计数）</td>\n<td>分位数、延迟形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Label / Attribute</td>\n<td>指标的可切分维度</td>\n<td>决定时序数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cardinality</td>\n<td>标签组合数</td>\n<td>存储成本的驱动因素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USE / RED</td>\n<td>资源视角 / 服务视角的指标框架</td>\n<td>覆盖两种监控对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burn-rate</td>\n<td>错误预算的消耗速率</td>\n<td>symptom-based 告警的基础</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>指标的价值完全取决于设计质量：类型选错（用 Gauge 求分位数）、标签基数爆炸、框架用错对象，都会让 Dashboard 无法回答问题或让 TSDB 成本失控。设计的第一步永远是先明确“要回答什么问题”，再选择类型与标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三套指标框架的适用场景\">三套指标框架的适用场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>提出者</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>核心维度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USE</td>\n<td>Brendan Gregg</td>\n<td><strong>资源</strong>（CPU、内存、磁盘、网络）</td>\n<td>Utilization / Saturation / Errors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RED</td>\n<td>Tom Wilkie (Grafana)</td>\n<td><strong>服务</strong>（API、微服务端点）</td>\n<td>Rate / Errors / Duration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四大黄金信号</td>\n<td>Google SRE Book</td>\n<td><strong>面向用户的系统</strong></td>\n<td>Latency / Traffic / Errors / Saturation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q{你在监控什么？}&#10;    Q --&gt;|硬件/基础设施资源| USE[USE Method&lt;br/&gt;CPU/Mem/Disk/Network]&#10;    Q --&gt;|微服务 API 端点| RED[RED Method&lt;br/&gt;Request-focused]&#10;    Q --&gt;|面向用户的整体服务| GOLD[四大黄金信号&lt;br/&gt;SRE 视角]\">graph TD\n    Q{你在监控什么？}\n    Q --&gt;|硬件/基础设施资源| USE[USE Method&lt;br/&gt;CPU/Mem/Disk/Network]\n    Q --&gt;|微服务 API 端点| RED[RED Method&lt;br/&gt;Request-focused]\n    Q --&gt;|面向用户的整体服务| GOLD[四大黄金信号&lt;br/&gt;SRE 视角]</pre><p><strong>它们不是互斥的。</strong> 一个完整的可观测性体系通常同时使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>USE 监控 Node/Pod 级资源（Kubernetes <code>node_exporter</code> / <code>cAdvisor</code>）</li>\n<li>RED 监控每个微服务端点（OTel <code>spanmetrics</code> connector 自动生成）</li>\n<li>黄金信号作为最顶层的 SLI（对接 SLO 框架）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"use-method-详解\">USE Method 详解</h2><p>对每一类资源，检查三个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>Prometheus 示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Utilization</td>\n<td>资源忙碌时间百分比</td>\n<td><code>rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode!=&quot;idle&quot;}[5m])</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saturation</td>\n<td>排队/超额请求的程度</td>\n<td><code>node_load1 / count(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=&quot;idle&quot;})</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Errors</td>\n<td>错误事件计数</td>\n<td><code>rate(node_disk_io_errors_total[5m])</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Utilization</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Busy Time</mtext><mtext>Total Time</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Utilization} = \\frac{\\text{Busy Time}}{\\text{Total Time}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Utilization</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Time</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Busy Time</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>USE 的核心洞察：<strong>Saturation 是最早的预警信号</strong>——当 utilization 还在 70% 时，saturation（队列深度）可能已经在增长，意味着系统即将到达拐点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"red-method-详解\">RED Method 详解</h2><p>对每一个服务端点，度量三个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>OTel Metric 命名</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rate</td>\n<td>每秒请求数</td>\n<td><code>http.server.request.duration_count</code> (rate)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Errors</td>\n<td>每秒错误请求数</td>\n<td><code>http.server.request.duration_count{http.response.status_code=~&quot;5..&quot;}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duration</td>\n<td>请求延迟分布</td>\n<td><code>http.server.request.duration</code> (histogram)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OTel Collector 的 <code>spanmetrics</code> connector 可以零配置地从 trace span 生成 RED 指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"connectors:&#10;  spanmetrics:&#10;    dimensions:&#10;      - name: http.request.method&#10;      - name: http.route&#10;      - name: http.response.status_code&#10;    histogram:&#10;      explicit:&#10;        buckets: [5ms, 10ms, 25ms, 50ms, 100ms, 250ms, 500ms, 1s, 2.5s, 5s, 10s]&#10;    exemplars:&#10;      enabled: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">connectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  spanmetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dimensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.request.method</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.route</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.response.status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    histogram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      explicit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        buckets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">25ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">50ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">250ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">500ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2.5s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    exemplars</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"metric-类型选择\">Metric 类型选择</h2><p>Prometheus/OTel 定义了四种基本类型，选错类型是初学者最常犯的错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>累计计数，只增不减</td>\n<td><code>rate()</code> 求速率</td>\n<td><code>http_requests_total</code>、<code>errors_total</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>瞬时值，可增可减</td>\n<td>直接读取当前值</td>\n<td><code>temperature</code>、<code>queue_size</code>、<code>goroutines</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>值分布（桶计数）</td>\n<td><code>histogram_quantile()</code> 求分位数</td>\n<td><code>request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Summary</td>\n<td>客户端计算分位数</td>\n<td>不可聚合</td>\n<td>已不推荐，用 Histogram 替代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键决策：何时用 Histogram vs Gauge？</strong></p>\n<p>如果你需要回答&quot;P99 延迟是多少&quot;或&quot;延迟分布是什么形状&quot;——用 Histogram。如果你只需要当前值或平均值——Gauge 配合 <code>avg_over_time</code> 即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签设计与基数控制\">标签设计与基数控制</h2><p>标签（Labels/Attributes）决定了 metric 的<strong>可切分维度</strong>。每增加一个 label value，时序数就倍增：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>时序数</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>label</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>values</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{时序数} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |\\text{label}_i.\\text{values}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时序数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">label</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">values</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如：<code>method</code> (5 值) × <code>status_code</code> (5 值) × <code>endpoint</code> (100 值) × <code>region</code> (4 值) = 10,000 条时序。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>只用低基数 label</strong></td>\n<td>可枚举的维度：method、status_code、region、service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>高基数值放 exemplar 或 trace</strong></td>\n<td>user_id、order_id、trace_id 绝不做 label</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>参数化路径</strong></td>\n<td><code>/api/orders/{id}</code> 而非 <code>/api/orders/12345</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>基数上限 &lt; 10,000</strong></td>\n<td>超过则 TSDB 性能和成本急剧恶化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预定义 allowed values</strong></td>\n<td>用 enum/allowlist，避免脏数据导致基数飘升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"histogram-bucket-设计\">Histogram Bucket 设计</h2><p>Bucket 边界直接影响分位数计算精度。设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基于 SLO 对齐</strong>：如果 SLO 是 P99 &lt; 500ms，确保 500ms 附近有密集 bucket</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖期望范围</strong>：从最快（~5ms）到超时上限（~30s）</li>\n<li><strong>对数分布</strong>：低延迟区间密、高延迟区间疏</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 通用 HTTP 服务推荐 bucket&#10;buckets: [5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2500, 5000, 10000]&#10;# 单位 ms&#10;&#10;# 数据库查询推荐 bucket&#10;buckets: [1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50, 100, 200, 500, 1000, 5000]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 通用 HTTP 服务推荐 bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>buckets: [5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2500, 5000, 10000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 单位 ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 数据库查询推荐 bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>buckets: [1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50, 100, 200, 500, 1000, 5000]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"从零设计服务指标体系\">从零设计服务指标体系</h2><p>以一个&quot;订单服务&quot;为例，按层级构建指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>标签</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>SLI 层</strong></td>\n<td><code>order_service_request_duration</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>method, route, status</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>业务层</strong></td>\n<td><code>orders_created_total</code></td>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>payment_method, channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>业务层</strong></td>\n<td><code>order_amount</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>currency</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>依赖层</strong></td>\n<td><code>db_query_duration</code></td>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>operation, table</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>依赖层</strong></td>\n<td><code>cache_hit_ratio</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>cache_name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>资源层</strong></td>\n<td><code>process_resident_memory_bytes</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>资源层</strong></td>\n<td><code>go_goroutines</code></td>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"告警规则设计模式\">告警规则设计模式</h2><p>好的告警基于 <strong>symptom</strong>（用户感知到的问题）而非 <strong>cause</strong>（内部原因）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于 symptom（推荐）</td>\n<td>&quot;5 分钟内 P99 延迟 &gt; 2s&quot; → 用户体验受损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于 cause（避免）</td>\n<td>&quot;CPU &gt; 80%&quot; → 不一定影响用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burn-rate 告警（最佳）</td>\n<td>&quot;过去 1h 错误率消耗了月度预算的 2%&quot; → 精确对应 SLO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"# Burn-rate 告警：1h 窗口 14.4x burn rate（99.9% SLO）&#10;(&#10;  rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1h])&#10;  / rate(http_requests_total[1h])&#10;) &gt; 14.4 * 0.001\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Burn-rate 告警：1h 窗口 14.4x burn rate（99.9% SLO）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1h])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  / rate(http_requests_total[1h])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) > 14.4 * 0.001</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于如何将 Trace 数据自动生成 RED 指标（spanmetrics），参见 <a href=\"distributed-tracing-practice\">分布式追踪实践</a>。Burn-rate 告警与 SLO 框架的完整设计，参见 <a href=\"service-level-objectives\">SLO 与错误预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>指标是成本最低、保留最久的信号，但它的价值完全由设计质量决定。三套框架各司其职：USE 监控资源、RED 监控服务端点、四大黄金信号作为顶层 SLI，它们不是互斥而是分层使用的。设计时的三条硬约束是：选对类型（分位数用 Histogram 而非 Gauge 或 Summary）、控制基数（高基数值放 exemplar 或 trace，绝不做 label，上限 &lt; 10,000）、对齐 SLO 设计 bucket。告警应基于 symptom 而非 cause，最佳的 symptom 形式是 burn-rate——它把“用户体验受损”精确映射到错误预算的消耗。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指标设计模式","id":"指标设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三套指标框架的适用场景","id":"三套指标框架的适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"USE Method 详解","id":"use-method-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"RED Method 详解","id":"red-method-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Metric 类型选择","id":"metric-类型选择"},{"level":2,"text":"标签设计与基数控制","id":"标签设计与基数控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Histogram Bucket 设计","id":"histogram-bucket-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"从零设计服务指标体系","id":"从零设计服务指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"告警规则设计模式","id":"告警规则设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式追踪实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/distributed-tracing-practice"},"next":{"title":"SLO 与错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/service-level-objectives"}}